<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean firms buy 23,600T oilseed meal.</title>
<headline>S.Korean firms buy 23,600T oilseed meal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korean firms on Friday jointly bought 12,500 tonnes of Chinese wheatbran pellet and 11,100 tonnes of Indian rapeseed meal, traders said.</p>
<p>They said the companies passed on a tender for 12,000 tonnes of cottonseed meal due to high offer prices.</p>
